# The siege variant of the tech arm: heavyArtillery joins the heavies.
# The roster probe proved all three heavies sit behind the same single
# 2,000-credit T2 unlock -- and heavyArtillery (3,100 credits, reach 310)
# out-ranges every turret in the game, which is the exact wall the
# Impossible autopsies said non-wins die against ([[ai-opponent-strategy]],
# [[mechanics-build-actions]]). At Hard income the 3,100 never funded
# (asked 76, got 0); whether it funds from a Very Hard economy is this
# arm's question.

name tech-siege
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank,heavyArtillery
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
